  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W42",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "经过一段时间的环境演变，Zeta单卡对环境的影响基本比较明确。[[card:Baleful Strix|恶邪枭]]毫无疑问是最强单卡，蓝黑控制、蓝黑仙灵现在都处于环境顶端。[[card:Vandalblast|蛮野冲击]]虽然不是所有红色套牌都带，但备牌为了[[card:Vandalblast|蛮野冲击]]混红的控制现在是最流行的版本。而[[card:Dispatch|迅速了结]]套牌相对有些掉队，以艾斯波共鸣为首的这类套牌甚至已经可以归入“其他”。",
          "en": "After a period of metagame evolution, the impact of the Zeta cards has become fairly clear. [[card:Baleful Strix|Baleful Strix]] is undoubtedly the strongest card, with Dimir Control and Dimir Faeries both now at the top of the metagame. Not every red deck plays [[card:Vandalblast|Vandalblast]], but control builds splashing red for it in the sideboard are now the most popular variants. Meanwhile, [[card:Dispatch|Dispatch]] decks have fallen somewhat behind. These decks, led by Esper Affinity, can now even be grouped under “Other.”"
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "FRA新牌方面，[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]在上周进入红风暴套牌之后，本周一些纯红疯魔套牌也开始使用。一套把[[card:Kessig Flamebreather|凯锡革喷焰师]]换成[[card:Kiln Fiend|火炉邪鬼]]的版本拿下一个八强：deck:f3bc98dff40ca00607c5，备牌带了一张[[card:Twinned Vision|双生视像]]。而另一个主1备3，用它作为备牌资源计划的版本拿下一个四强：deck:3661808034b758be269b。",
          "en": "Among the new FRA cards, [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] began appearing in Ruby Storm last week, and some Mono-Red Madness decks have started using it this week as well. A build replacing [[card:Kessig Flamebreather|Kessig Flamebreather]] with [[card:Kiln Fiend|Kiln Fiend]] made the Top 8: deck:f3bc98dff40ca00607c5, with one [[card:Twinned Vision|Twinned Vision]] in the sideboard. Another build, running one copy in the main deck and three in the sideboard as a resource plan after sideboarding, reached the semifinals: deck:3661808034b758be269b."
        },
